                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is H&amp;M's biggest advantage over Zara?</h3>
                                        <p>Earlier + deeper eCommerce investment + more aggressive celebrity + designer collabs. Zara wins on supply chain velocity.</p>
                                        <h3>Is H&amp;M's sustainability positioning credible?</h3>
                                        <p>Contested. Substantial investment but critics highlight fast-fashion overall throughput. Positioning is deliberate long-term commitment.</p>
                                        <h3>How often does H&amp;M do designer collabs?</h3>
                                        <p>1-3 major collabs per year. Each drives 2-4 week traffic + PR spikes + brand-halo effect.</p>
                                        <h3>What can smaller fashion brands learn from H&amp;M?</h3>
                                        <p>Strategic collabs as marketing events, early digital investment, substantiated sustainability positioning, regional merchandising.</p>
